{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE AGAINST THE ASH CLAN IN THE FROM THE ASHES EXPANSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/55ecd3f62d234e615da57f4d8b4491f1.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/55ecd3f62d234e615da57f4d8b4491f1.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora\u2122 is a third and first-person action-adventure game set in the Western Frontier. Abducted by the RDA, you, a Na\u2019vi, were molded to serve their purpose. Fifteen years later, you are free, but find yourself a stranger in your birthplace. Reconnect with your lost heritage and discover what it truly means to be Na'vi as you join other clans to protect Pandora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A WORLD OF WONDER AND DANGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/dd8b692747dc3b380f1c1966331b3ab4.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/dd8b692747dc3b380f1c1966331b3ab4.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the epic wonders of the Western Frontier, a never-before-seen continent of Pandora. Journey through beautiful yet unpredictable open world regions, where lowering your guard can lead to deadly mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME NA\u2019VI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/0609738389bc8062b45fdb5537dd805c.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/0609738389bc8062b45fdb5537dd805c.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your incredible strength and agility while customizing your character, crafting new gear, and upgrading skills and weapons to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOAR THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/1f7021c9348fa603ec247ffb94920531.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/1f7021c9348fa603ec247ffb94920531.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your own personal banshee that will give you an edge in aerial combat and can be used for traveling across the vast Western Frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER MULTIPLE COMBAT STYLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/a7be18b72e54c4b8ab6843ee7bda291b.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/a7be18b72e54c4b8ab6843ee7bda291b.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off the dangers of Pandora as you embrace the precision of traditional Na\u2019vi weapons, including your bow and spear-thrower, or leverage your human training with more destructive weapons, such as an assault rifle or a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE YOUR ADVENTURE IN FULL CAMPAIGN CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/abfcc748278254a1a09be780c900f0d1.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/abfcc748278254a1a09be780c900f0d1.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the full story campaign in single-player or with a friend online in two-player co-op.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Our Reclamation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/74885b3597b9655cdd03128cbba0e1e92428c272.jpg"},{"name":"No Easy Prey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/51c808dc1f7028d77650c595f1f72b1dc24a5350.jpg"},{"name":"Talk to the Ancestors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/3bff93d063e1fd810697cc9be944d90a773f844a.jpg"},{"name":"Sprouting Potential","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/823b6c3d49c60330170e21be2d8de7857aea5f95.jpg"},{"name":"Full Bloom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/314dd652ecb42969dc6502b7c56ee7648b88d932.jpg"},{"name":"Tethered Kites","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/d9b41bdaa3c0a893bc7e0ed9e6aaba58b45684a9.jpg"},{"name":"First Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/50f5010aefee7cbb8667b8a320d819d4eb1e3cb2.jpg"},{"name":"Aranahe Alliance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/3acb842e6f45979a6490befbcae8511031577ba3.jpg"},{"name":"Stronger Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/b97b900f87aff1df7c65a09e88983287e61d7bdf.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing the Mist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2840770/a8c26da7d8e0a0d6cea3ca1cbd6ed3d2b25adbed.jpg"}],"total":52},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2840770?t=1769463197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2840770?t=1769463197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/cc7f801396b237394d4e014e03cb0d5cac04cc22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769463197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/cc7f801396b237394d4e014e03cb0d5cac04cc22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769463197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Comparison Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/00eaee6f6f4222569fa8fddc4f89bff7.avif?t=1769463197\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Complete Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/46ddfd5e47a60b6fa529e66e00760264.avif?t=1769463197\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the base game, the season pass, cosmetics, bonus content, the digital artbook, and the From the Ashes expansion inspired by the Avatar: Fire and Ash film.</p></p><br><h1>From the Ashes Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/b0eea0049d3e204cd78998683788a42e.avif?t=1769463197\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Pandora adventure in the From the Ashes expansion, inspired by the new Avatar: Fire and Ash film.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the main game, From the Ashes expansion and bonus content.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISE AGAINST THE ASH CLAN IN THE FROM THE ASHES EXPANSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/55ecd3f62d234e615da57f4d8b4491f1.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/55ecd3f62d234e615da57f4d8b4491f1.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora\u2122 is a third and first-person action-adventure game set in the Western Frontier. Abducted by the RDA, you, a Na\u2019vi, were molded to serve their purpose. Fifteen years later, you are free, but find yourself a stranger in your birthplace. Reconnect with your lost heritage and discover what it truly means to be Na'vi as you join other clans to protect Pandora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A WORLD OF WONDER AND DANGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/dd8b692747dc3b380f1c1966331b3ab4.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/dd8b692747dc3b380f1c1966331b3ab4.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the epic wonders of the Western Frontier, a never-before-seen continent of Pandora. Journey through beautiful yet unpredictable open world regions, where lowering your guard can lead to deadly mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME NA\u2019VI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/0609738389bc8062b45fdb5537dd805c.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/0609738389bc8062b45fdb5537dd805c.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your incredible strength and agility while customizing your character, crafting new gear, and upgrading skills and weapons to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOAR THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/1f7021c9348fa603ec247ffb94920531.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/1f7021c9348fa603ec247ffb94920531.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your own personal banshee that will give you an edge in aerial combat and can be used for traveling across the vast Western Frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER MULTIPLE COMBAT STYLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/a7be18b72e54c4b8ab6843ee7bda291b.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/a7be18b72e54c4b8ab6843ee7bda291b.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off the dangers of Pandora as you embrace the precision of traditional Na\u2019vi weapons, including your bow and spear-thrower, or leverage your human training with more destructive weapons, such as an assault rifle or a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE YOUR ADVENTURE IN FULL CAMPAIGN CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/abfcc748278254a1a09be780c900f0d1.poster.avif?t=1769463197\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840770/extras/abfcc748278254a1a09be780c900f0d1.webm?t=1769463197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the full story campaign in single-player or with a friend online in two-player co-op.</p>","developers":["Massive Entertainment \u2013 A Ubisof